Beyond the 9-item floor (no scope narrowing), the page also reproduces every other
region of the web source via the native P3 sub-surfaces, each bound from the @Observable
model: SummaryStatsRow (4 TSStatCards), SecurityStatusCards, WindowStatusDetail,
LiveVehicleState, SentryModeChart (Swift Charts), SecurityStatistics, EventHistoryTable,
EventTimeline — plus a working VehicleSelect (binds useVehicles → reloads the security
