own loading/empty/error states. SI/units: the admin security control-plane is unit-free;
no non-SI values are stored or computed. a11y: accessibilityLabel/traits on panels,
headers marked, ≥44pt Picker targets, Dynamic Type via the typography tokens, light/dark
via Color.TS dynamic colors.

